kebLKvBV-bEQ7kNvwFipLPN&_nc_oc=AdqJLl7htXLhazLilLRbEoF1VIlgwB1hee_UFcIDdR6kxKbrkU3Bl9XP8-2Db_xKfec&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2dm5_ATGatxPeZeRXBGrv9dmlWmaMxnPNIwU1tmD2ITA&oe=69D51137"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-YXYVBWn_64Q7kNvwH_ys3H&_nc_oc=Adod2z76KNAWBUoxh4Q4XpQint52md6xx0cCSBGxBKsCYUpBWhukuuAPWoL4gMMdFoU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2gXPSUf45wP475a_WpdYmSoO6Gw_-ZkOD8_HWhGi7wgw&oe=69D512CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oCAQJ6UBx4YQ7kNvwGtbs4U&_nc_oc=AdoykZ79j83QILs8xTaZMAXb8A4xWtzX2YU0oShooCU3fp2DzeyGmzsN_HpasgM4UZI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0Ip7glcYa3trkx4WZUwImE90KbHbRky9cy6Q6-_L68Ag&oe=69D4FFEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vE8CvjXTI58Q7kNvwFhtq_F&_nc_oc=AdrGpRBkliLGED8LV_3TAds8y8yIz4RGZTRZJHgbCVhY8WRnahLAQpVPnQ6iqBk34Ew&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2cTD8jXtE4s5XxFZtxHJ1uMoyR87SZf1r52px0A2T01w&oe=69D4E943"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ETc5HCmHrS8Q7kNvwFHpVpb&_nc_oc=AdpiTnAPOBtHNtOc3x6Q2O_SPD8zLC7HJvNSb93Ife1z5tOxx4s6cKKO_CySXuiAErQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2yRW7xjsdwSH5GYMbj43ZPPorFWo4Pvawnwaetn1VbMQ&oe=69D519D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K_3pKAp00vsQ7kNvwGFekXS&_nc_oc=AdqO-Yl37XDW65-_RW1FHZV-sViV3EOE0mv3eKqeULJYG8QTpk3j8Eeo0q3Nezj0kyw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0U8TqflFtgfwcoTAWaVYbk18DrNQssMZIXzfHWr4J9Fw&oe=69D4F4BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080